          "Zerodha returns to `/api/admin/market/kite/callback`. You must be signed in; the state cookie must verify and match; a status other than success shows “The Kite login was cancelled.”; the request token (6–64 letters or digits) is exchanged for an access token using a checksum of key, token and secret.",
